  m_text: "<size=22>- Player can play Keno Dollar once bet is set up.\n- Before playing
    Keno Dollar, one chooses 10 numbers from 1 to 80.\n- Once clicking PLAY button,
    20 balls with random numbers from 1 to 80 are drawn. \n- If the numbers of dropped
    balls match with 10 numbers player chose, then player wins.\n- Depending on the
    number of matching numbers, win pay varies. </size>"
